출처: [Data Visualization with ggplot2::CHEATSHEET](https://rstudio.github.io/cheatsheets/html/data-visualization.html)


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
library(ggplot2)
library(SparseM)
library(quantreg)
library(hexbin)
e <- ggplot(mpg, aes(cty, hwy))
f <- ggplot(mpg, aes(class, hwy))
g <- ggplot(diamonds, aes(cut, color))
h <- ggplot(diamonds, aes(carat, price))
i <- ggplot(economics, aes(date, unemploy))
```
:::


#### 두 변수 모두 연속형

##### geom_label()

- 텍스트 박스 그리는 함수
- aes() 인자: x, y, label, alpha, angle, color, family, fontface, hjust, lineheight, size, vjust


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
e + geom_label(aes(label = cty))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-2vars_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-2-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### geom_point()

- 산점도(scatter plot) 그리는 함수
- aes() 인자: x, y, alpha, color, fill, shape, size, stroke


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
e + geom_point()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-2vars_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-3-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### geom_quantile()

- 출력된 데이터에 분위 회귀선 추가하는 함수
- aes() 인자: x, y, alpha, color, group, linetype, linewidth, weight


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
e + geom_quantile()
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stderr}

```
Smoothing formula not specified. Using: y ~ x
```


:::

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-2vars_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### geom_rug()

- 선분(러그) 그래프 그리는 함수
- aes() 인자: x, y, alpha, color, linetype, linewidth


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
e + geom_rug(sides = "bl")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-2vars_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-5-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### geom_smooth()

- 평활화된 조건부 평균 그리는 함수
- aes() 인자: x, y, alpha, color, fill, group, linetype, linewidth, weight


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
e + geom_smooth(method = lm)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stderr}

```
`geom_smooth()` using formula = 'y ~ x'
```


:::

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-2vars_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-6-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### geom_text()

- 출력된 그래프에 텍스트 추가하는 함수
- aes() 인자: x, y, label, alpha, angle, color, family, fontface, hjust, lineheight, size, vjust


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
e + geom_text(aes(label = cty))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-2vars_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-7-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



#### 한 변수 이산형, 한 변수 연속형

##### geom_col()

